{"lines": ["Six crew and a Boeing 707 vanished off Tokyo, and not one piece was ever found.", "Varig Flight 967 leaves Tokyo at eight twenty-three at night, January nineteen seventy-nine.", "At eight forty-five, the crew make their last radio call.", "But its captain had cheated death before. In nineteen seventy-three he survived a burning Varig jet near Paris, where one hundred twenty-three people died.", "The next call, due at nine twenty-three, never comes. About two hundred kilometres from Tokyo, the jet, its crew, and a cargo of paintings worth one point two four million dollars are simply gone.", "No wreckage. No bodies. Not one painting.", "Did something fail too fast for a call, or did the Pacific swallow the whole Boeing 707?"], "words": [["Six", 0.0, 0.18], ["crew", 0.18, 0.5], ["and", 0.5, 0.88], ["a", 0.88, 0.94], ["Boeing", 0.94, 1.24], ["707", 1.24, 2.1], ["vanished", 2.1, 3.08], ["off", 3.08, 3.54], ["Tokyo,", 3.54, 4.04], ["and", 4.3, 4.42], ["not", 4.42, 4.58], ["one", 4.58, 4.82], ["piece", 4.82, 5.14], ["was", 5.14, 5.4], ["ever", 5.4, 5.6], ["found.", 5.6, 6.08], ["Varig", 6.44, 6.797], ["Flight", 6.797, 7.037], ["967", 7.037, 8.037], ["leaves", 8.037, 9.357], ["Tokyo", 9.357, 9.937], ["at", 9.937, 10.457], ["eight", 10.457, 10.682], ["twenty-three", 10.682, 11.177], ["at", 11.177, 11.597], ["night,", 11.597, 11.817], ["January", 12.077, 12.417], ["nineteen", 12.417, 12.628], ["seventy-nine.", 12.628, 12.917], ["At", 13.277, 13.371], ["eight", 13.371, 13.571], ["forty-five,", 13.571, 13.931], ["the", 14.191, 14.291], ["crew", 14.291, 14.471], ["make", 14.471, 14.751], ["their", 14.751, 14.991], ["last", 14.991, 15.251], ["radio", 15.251, 15.851], ["call.", 15.851, 16.231], ["But", 16.591, 16.637], ["its", 16.637, 16.717], ["captain", 16.717, 17.077], ["had", 17.077, 17.377], ["cheated", 17.377, 17.717], ["death", 17.717, 18.057], ["before.", 18.057, 18.437], ["In", 18.797, 18.937], ["nineteen", 18.937, 19.233], ["seventy-three", 19.233, 19.677], 